io pack, and corrected restart journey.\n\nAPI-FIND-008 — TEAM-005/RST-001, AC-010/lifecycle, preliminary Unclear. Expected revision notification -> same-task resubmit -> reviewer acceptance and clean shutdown. Observed: initial submit and request_revision succeeded; revision arrived ~5m08s later; revised submit_task_result started with AORG-TEAM-TASK-REVISED-002 but never returned or persisted before shutdown >1 minute later. SIGINT exited 1: General process run supervisor close failed. Please distinguish production task-delivery/tool completion/supervisor origin from Codex runtime behavior.\n\nAPI-FIND-009 — TEAM-007/RST-003/004, AC-007/009/011, preliminary Local Fix (web Team restore/send). Expected inactive Team lazy restore then exact triggering input dispatch. Observed restore succeeded, but AORG-TEAM-UI-LAZY-RESTORE-002 is absent from every durable Team trace; immediate retry after activation persisted and responded. This contradicts the mocked restore-then-send intent in agentTeamRunStore.spec.ts.\n\nAPI-FIND-010 — ORG-010, AC-009/014 and DS-019, preliminary Local Fix/design conformance. Expected normal Stop Org to release the active target and show truthful inactive/history UI. Observed descendants and root became inactive with Restore, but the selected main pane remained indefinitely \"Connecting to Agent Org...\" against a non-active root. STATUS-003 screenshot directly captures both states.\n\nAPI-FIND-011 — UI-002/ORG-002, AC-002/014, preliminary Design Impact or web Product-spec conformance. Expected 390x844 collapsed navigation to retain exact Agent/Team focus switching. Observed the focused Org has zero hierarchy treeitems and no member selector/drawer; the header is noninteractive and the visible plus opens new Agent configuration. Please route to Architecture Designer if the source follows the reviewed design rather than omitting an intended control.\n\nMaterial passes: standalone Team conversation/handoff; fresh task Agent submission/acceptance; mounted-Team-under-Org fresh TeamRun submission/acceptance and settled ownership; direct Org Refresh->inactive Restore with exact provider durability/content rules; two-family history/persistence; expanded/collapsed-running/stopped mounted-Team status; final roots inactive; final shutdown clean; ports/PIDs/tabs cleaned; fixture hashes unchanged. Live Org task-Agent, Org task revision, live authoring, destructive binding copies, and separate-process migration variants remain explicitly Not Tested or repository-only.\n\nCanonical current truth is api-e2e-coverage-investigation.md, api-e2e-execution-coverage-report.md, and API-REV-002 in api-e2e-revision-record.md.","reference_files":["/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/requirements-doc.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/investigation-notes.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/requirements-revision-record.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/agent-org-contract.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/design-spec.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/architecture-design-revision-record.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/architecture-design-self-validation.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-progress/flat-agent-organization-model/design-review-report.md","/home/autobyteus/workspace/.codex/worktrees/flat-agent-organization-model/tickets/in-pr